  (text "RX10 with CX6: 5.89 kHz (interLp)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 128.27 55.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "463ec245-50f0-5189-aaa7-95c0af1d1747"))
  (text "Section 4 of the circuit notes, stage 5. The series' module is reported to have two gain stages [3]; their circuits are not\npublic.\nUX5 with RVX5: the Drive gain, 0 to 30 dB log-uniform (driveMaxDb, chosen). RX9 and DX1 to DX4: a soft clip at about two\ndiode drops, standing in for the DSP's tanh at +/-1.2 V (v1, chosen). RX10, CX6: the 6 kHz inter-stage low-pass (interLp, chosen)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c4e9ae50-1849-50bd-a6b4-b37f917b0265"))
